\paragraph{Post-SFT accuracy does not predict GRPO outcome.}
\label{sec:sft_gradient}
Under SFT alone, CKA-only (63.91\%) $>$ \rasp{} (61.49\%) $>$ Standard (59.29\%) $>$ Random (51.25\%), yet under GRPO the \rasp{}/Standard ordering reverses and Random outperforms both in peak reward.
The spectrum is driven by structural properties of the pruned architecture, not post-SFT accuracy.

